so it'd be great if Two Cents fans

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.770
were well-represented in the polls.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:27.570
There's a link in the description.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:28.743
Thanks in advance.

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:30.720
If you wanna know more

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:33.540
about the inflationary
period boomers faced,

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:34.657
check out our video,

00:07:34.657 --> 00:07:37.027
"If You Thought This Inflation Was Bad."

00:07:37.027 --> 00:07:39.610
(bright music)

